{'symbol': 'KSU', 'date': '2021-03-27 01:48:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION OF KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN - KSU', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JUAN MONTEVERDE , FOUNDER AND MANAGING PARTNER AT MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC, A NATIONAL SECURITIES FIRM RATED\xa0TOP 50\xa0IN THE 2018 AND 2019 ISS SECURITIES CLASS ACTION SERVICES REPORT AND HEADQUARTERED AT THE\xa0EMPIRE STATE BUILDING\xa0IN NEW YORK CITY, IS INVESTIGATING\xa0KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN ("KSU" OR THE "COMPANY") (KSU)\xa0RELATING TO ITS PROPOSED ACQUISITION BY CANADIAN PACIFIC RAILWAY.\xa0UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, KSU SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE $90.00 IN CASH AND 0.489 SHARES OF CANADIAN PACIFIC PER SHARE THEY OWN.'}